      "rendered_notes": "## [0.0.0-c07] - 2026-10-08\n\n### Added\n- `ir`: Persist content-bound relations between separate value uncertainty channels: Resolve producer-stamped complete quantity lineage and retain separate identification/native uncertainty artifacts with typed rate conversion.\n\n## Compatibility Notes\n- Additive schema 1.0 relation; existing ValueOuterSet and Envelope 1.1 unchanged. Default manifest views only; selected-view inputs refuse explicitly. A relation is nongating content consistency and never supplies scientific admission.\n\n## Change Classes\n- internal\n\n## Supported Surface Classification\n- public_stable: versioned IR subject/relation and typed refs; internal: producer/readback helpers\n"
